each thread_id has its own history, so thread_b did not replay thread_a results and the repeat run of thread_a replayed everything; 12 events are two threads of six each"}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Reading the Verified Output","textKn":"ಪರಿಶೀಲಿತ Output ಓದುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Crash, Recovery and Naive Retry","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: Crash, ಚೇತರಿಕೆ ಮತ್ತು Naive ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ","bodyEn":"Section 1: after the simulated crash each of collect_data and analyze_data had run once and 4 events were on disk; recovery returned Final value: 20, ran generate_report once and left 6 events. Section 2: a naive retry ran collect_data twice, analyze_data twice and generate_report once, 5 bodies in all against 3 for the durable run.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 1: ಅನುಕರಿತ crash ನಂತರ collect_data ಮತ್ತು analyze_data ತಲಾ ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಓಡಿದ್ದವು ಮತ್ತು ಡಿಸ್ಕ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ 4 events ಇದ್ದವು; ಚೇತರಿಕೆ Final value: 20 ಹಿಂತಿರುಗಿಸಿತು, generate_report ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಓಡಿಸಿ 6 events ಬಿಟ್ಟಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 2: naive ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ collect_data ಎರಡು ಬಾರಿ, analyze_data ಎರಡು ಬಾರಿ ಮತ್ತು generate_report ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಓಡಿಸಿತು, ಒಟ್ಟು 5 ದೇಹ, durable ಓಟದ 3 ವಿರುದ್ಧ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Drift, Failures and Threads","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: Drift, ವೈಫಲ್ಯಗಳು ಮತ್ತು Threads","bodyEn":"Section 3: calling analyze with 50 after it completed with 10 raised Activity input mismatch: analyze, and calling it with 10 again returned the stored 20. Section 4: a failing activity left the statuses started 1, failed 1, started 2, completed 2. Section 5: two thread_ids sharing one log each ran their own three bodies, and a repeat of thread_a replayed everything, leaving 12 events.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 3: 10 ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಪೂರ್ಣವಾದ ನಂತರ analyze ಅನ್ನು 50 ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಕರೆದಾಗ Activity input mismatch: analyze ಎದ್ದಿತು, ಮತ್ತು 10 ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಮತ್ತೆ ಕರೆದಾಗ ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿತ 20 ಹಿಂತಿರುಗಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 4: ವಿಫಲ activity started 1, failed 1, started 2, completed 2 ಸ್ಥಿತಿಗಳನ್ನು ಬಿಟ್ಟಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 5: ಒಂದು ಲಾಗ್ ಹಂಚಿಕೊಂಡ ಎರಡು thread_id ಗಳು ತಲಾ ತಮ್ಮ ಮೂರು ದೇಹ ಓಡಿಸಿದವು, ಮತ್ತು thread_a ಪುನರಾವರ್ತನೆ ಎಲ್ಲವನ್ನೂ ಮರುಪ್ರದರ್ಶಿಸಿ 12 events ಬಿಟ್ಟಿತು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Why AI Uses This","headingKn":"AI ಇದನ್ನು ಏಕೆ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ","bodyEn":"Replaying stored results turns a crash from a restart into a resume, and the fingerprint stops a changed input from quietly reusing an old answer.","bodyKn":"ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿತ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶಗಳನ್ನು ಮರುಪ್ರದರ್ಶಿಸುವುದು crash ಅನ್ನು ಮರುಪ್ರಾರಂಭದಿಂದ ಮುಂದುವರಿಕೆಯಾಗಿ ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು ಫಿಂಗರ್‌ಪ್ರಿಂಟ್ ಬದಲಾದ ಇನ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಹಳೆಯ ಉತ್ತರವನ್ನು ಮೌನವಾಗಿ ಮರುಬಳಸದಂತೆ ತಡೆಯುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Common Misconception","headingKn":"ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ","bodyEn":"Misconception: "durable execution means the activity never runs twice." A started record with no completed record still leads to a second run, which part 2 of this module examines.","bodyKn":"ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ: "durable execution ಎಂದರೆ activity ಎಂದಿಗೂ ಎರಡು ಬಾರಿ ಓಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ." ಪೂರ್ಣ ದಾಖಲೆ ಇಲ್ಲದ started ದಾಖಲೆ ಇನ್ನೂ ಎರಡನೇ ಓಟಕ್ಕೆ ಕಾರಣವಾಗುತ್ತದೆ, ಇದನ್ನು ಈ ಮಾಡ್ಯೂಲ್‌ನ ಭಾಗ 2 ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Terms","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಪದಗಳು","bodyEn":"Activity: a step whose result is recorded. Event log: the persistent history. Replay: return a stored result instead of running. Fingerprint: a hash of the arguments. thread_id: identifies one workflow session.","bodyKn":"Activity: ಫಲಿತಾಂಶ ದಾಖಲಿಸುವ ಹಂತ. Event log: ನಿರಂತರ ಇತಿಹಾಸ. Replay: ಓಡುವ ಬದಲು ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿತ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶ ಹಿಂತಿರುಗಿಸಿ. Fingerprint: ಆರ್ಗ್ಯುಮೆಂಟ್‌ಗಳ ಹ್ಯಾಶ್. thread_id: ಒಂದು workflow ಸೆಷನ್ ಗುರುತಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Takeaways","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಅಂಶಗಳು","bodyEn":"1) Recovery ran each body once and left 6 events. 2) Naive retry ran 5 bodies against 3. 3) A changed input raised a mismatch. 4) A failure then success recorded attempts 1 and 2. 5) Threads kept separate histories.","bodyKn":"1) ಚೇತರಿಕೆ ಪ್ರತಿ ದೇಹ ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಓಡಿಸಿ 6 events ಬಿಟ್ಟಿತು. 2) naive ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ 3 ವಿರುದ್ಧ 5 ದೇಹ ಓಡಿಸಿತು. 3) ಬದಲಾದ ಇನ್‌ಪುಟ್ mismatch ಎತ್ತಿತು. 4) ವೈಫಲ್ಯದ ನಂತರ ಯಶಸ್ಸು ಪ್ರಯತ್ನ 1 ಮತ್ತು 2 ದಾಖಲಿಸಿತು. 5) Threads ಪ್ರತ್ಯೇಕ ಇತಿಹಾಸ ಇಟ್ಟವು."}},{"type":"quiz","data":{"questions":[{"q":"How many activity bodies ran in total across the crash and the recovery?","qKn":"crash ಮತ್ತು ಚೇತರಿಕೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಒಟ್ಟು ಎಷ್ಟು activity ದೇಹಗಳು ಓಡಿದವು?","opts":["3","5","6","2"],"optsKn":["3","5","6","2"],"correct":0},{"q":"How many events were on disk after the recovery?","qKn":"ಚೇತರಿಕೆಯ ನಂತರ ಡಿಸ್ಕ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು events ಇದ್ದವು?","opts":["6","4","12","3"],"optsKn":["6","4","12","3"],"correct":0},{"q":"How many bodies did the naive retry run?","qKn":"naive ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ಎಷ್ಟು ದೇಹ ಓಡಿಸಿತು?","opts":["5","3","2","6"],"optsKn":["5","3","2","6"],"correct":0},{"q":"What happened when analyze was called with a different input after completing?","qKn":"ಪೂರ್ಣವಾದ ನಂತರ analyze ಅನ್ನು ಬೇರೆ ಇನ್‌ಪುಟ್‌ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಕರೆದಾಗ ಏನಾಯಿತು?","opts":["It raised an input mismatch","It returned the old result","It ran silently","It deleted the log"],"optsKn":["ಅದು ಇನ್‌ಪುಟ್ mismatch ಎತ್ತಿತು","ಅದು ಹಳೆಯ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶ ಹಿಂತಿರುಗಿಸಿತು","ಅದು ಮೌನವಾಗಿ ಓಡಿತು","ಅದು ಲಾಗ್ ಅಳಿಸಿತು"],"correct":0},{"q":"What does the fingerprint not cover?","qKn":"ಫಿಂಗರ್‌ಪ್ರಿಂಟ್ ಏನನ್ನು ಒಳಗೊಳ್ಳುವುದಿಲ್ಲ?","opts":["Function source and model version","The serialised arguments","The activity id","The thread id"],"optsKn":["ಕಾರ್ಯ ಮೂಲ ಮತ್ತು ಮಾದರಿ ಆವೃತ್ತಿ","ಸರಣಿಕರಿಸಿದ ಆರ್ಗ್ಯುಮೆಂಟ್‌ಗಳು","activity id","thread id"],"correct":0}]}}]

builderEn:
[{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Durable Execution for Long-Running Agents (Part 2 of 3)","textKn":"ದೀರ್ಘಕಾಲ ಓಡುವ Agents ಗೆ Durable Execution (ಭಾಗ 2 / 3)","level":"H1"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Lesson Info","headingKn":"Lesson ಮಾಹಿತಿ","bodyEn":"• Type: Build · Language: Python (stdlib only) · Time: ~60 minutes. Part 2 of 3: the three crash points around an outside effect, a mock payment service with and without an idempotency key, reconciliation by key, an exponential backoff schedule and bounded retries by error kind. Every output below was genuinely produced by the lab file on Python 3.14.5. This is our own stdlib model of the ideas behind durable execution for long-running agents (event logs, activity replay, input fingerprints, crash boundaries, idempotency keys, bounded retries, approvals, durable timers, persistent budgets and memory consolidation), not the real software, and the activities are tiny functions, the payment service and the deployment are in-memory mocks or counters, files live in a temporary directory, time is simulated and no real service or language model is involved, so no real LLM behaviour is measured. The original code/main.py was not supplied, and the lesson says its code is a reference implementation, so the labs are our own. Part 2 of the source lesson was cut off inside its section on retry policy, and the lab covers retries from Part 3 and from the policy list that Part 2 had started. The lesson March 2026 note about a Temporal and OpenAI Agents SDK milestone and its 35-minute reliability claim are curriculum statements, cited and not verified here. This lesson replaces the earlier lesson at this position.","bodyKn":"• Type: Build · ಭಾಷೆ: Python (stdlib ಮಾತ್ರ) · ಸಮಯ: ~60 ನಿಮಿಷ. ಮೂರು ಭಾಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ 2ನೆಯದು: ಹೊರಗಿನ ಪರಿಣಾಮದ ಸುತ್ತ ಮೂರು crash ಬಿಂದುಗಳು, idempotency ಕೀ ಇದ್ದು ಮತ್ತು ಇಲ್ಲದ ಮಾಕ್ ಪಾವತಿ ಸೇವೆ, ಕೀ ಮೂಲಕ ಸಮನ್ವಯ, ಘಾತೀಯ backoff ವೇಳಾಪಟ್ಟಿ ಮತ್ತು ದೋಷ ಪ್ರಕಾರದ ಪ್ರಕಾರ ಮಿತಿಯುಳ್ಳ ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ. ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ output ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಫೈಲ್ ಮೂಲಕ Python 3.14.5 ನಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಪಡೆದದ್ದು. ಇದು ದೀರ್ಘಕಾಲ ಓಡುವ agents ಗಾಗಿ durable execution (event ಲಾಗ್‌ಗಳು, activity ಮರುಪ್ರದರ್ಶನ, ಇನ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಫಿಂಗರ್‌ಪ್ರಿಂಟ್‌ಗಳು, crash ಗಡಿಗಳು, idempotency ಕೀಗಳು, ಮಿತಿಯುಳ್ಳ ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ, ಅನುಮೋದನೆಗಳು, durable ಟೈಮರ್‌ಗಳು, ನಿರಂತರ ಬಜೆಟ್‌ಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಮೆಮೊರಿ ಬಲವರ್ಧನೆ) ಹಿಂದಿನ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳ ನಮ್ಮದೇ stdlib ಮಾದರಿ, ನಿಜವಾದ ಸಾಫ್ಟ್‌ವೇರ್ ಅಲ್ಲ, ಮತ್ತು activities ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಕಾರ್ಯಗಳು, ಪಾವತಿ ಸೇವೆ ಮತ್ತು deployment ಮೆಮೊರಿ ಮಾಕ್ ಅಥವಾ ಕೌಂಟರ್‌ಗಳು, ಫೈಲ್‌ಗಳು ತಾತ್ಕಾಲಿಕ ಡೈರೆಕ್ಟರಿಯಲ್ಲಿವೆ, ಸಮಯ ಅನುಕರಿತ ಮತ್ತು ಯಾವ ನಿಜ ಸೇವೆ ಅಥವಾ ಭಾಷಾ ಮಾದರಿಯೂ ಇಲ್ಲ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಿಜವಾದ LLM ವರ್ತನೆ ಅಳೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿಲ್ಲ. ಮೂಲ code/main.py ಒದಗಿಸಿರಲಿಲ್ಲ, ಮತ್ತು lesson ತನ್ನ ಕೋಡ್ ಉಲ್ಲೇಖ ಅನುಷ್ಠಾನ ಎನ್ನುತ್ತದೆ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಲ್ಯಾಬ್‌ಗಳು ನಮ್ಮದೇ. ಮೂಲ lesson ನ ಭಾಗ 2 ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ನೀತಿ ವಿಭಾಗದ ಒಳಗೆ ಕತ್ತರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತ್ತು, ಮತ್ತು ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನಗಳನ್ನು ಭಾಗ 3 ಮತ್ತು ಭಾಗ 2 ಆರಂಭಿಸಿದ ನೀತಿ ಪಟ್ಟಿಯಿಂದ ಒಳಗೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತದೆ. Temporal ಮತ್ತು OpenAI Agents SDK ಮೈಲಿಗಲ್ಲಿನ ಬಗ್ಗೆ lesson ನ 2026 ಮಾರ್ಚ್ ಟಿಪ್ಪಣಿ ಮತ್ತು ಅದರ 35-ನಿಮಿಷ ವಿಶ್ವಾಸಾರ್ಹತೆ ಹೇಳಿಕೆ ಪಠ್ಯಕ್ರಮ ಹೇಳಿಕೆಗಳು, ಉಲ್ಲೇಖಿತ ಮತ್ತು ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಲಾಗಿಲ್ಲ. ಈ lesson ಈ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಹಿಂದಿನ lesson ಅನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Replay Is Not Enough for Outside Effects","textKn":"ಹೊರಗಿನ ಪರಿಣಾಮಗಳಿಗೆ ಮರುಪ್ರದರ್ಶನ ಸಾಕಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Three Crash Points, One Dangerous One","headingKn":"ಮೂರು Crash ಬಿಂದುಗಳು, ಒಂದು ಅಪಾಯಕಾರಿ","bodyEn":"An activity that charges a customer has three places where a crash can land: before the call, after the call but before the completed record, or after the record. Replay handles the last. This part injects a crash at each point against a mock payment service, shows the double charge in the middle case, fixes it with an idempotency key, reconciles by asking the service about the key, computes an exponential backoff schedule and runs bounded retries for retryable and non-retryable errors. No real service is used.","bodyKn":"ಗ್ರಾಹಕರಿಗೆ ಶುಲ್ಕ ವಿಧಿಸುವ activity ಗೆ crash ಇಳಿಯಬಹುದಾದ ಮೂರು ಸ್ಥಳಗಳಿವೆ: ಕರೆಗೆ ಮೊದಲು, ಕರೆಯ ನಂತರ ಆದರೆ ಪೂರ್ಣ ದಾಖಲೆಗೆ ಮೊದಲು, ಅಥವಾ ದಾಖಲೆಯ ನಂತರ. ಮರುಪ್ರದರ್ಶನ ಕೊನೆಯದನ್ನು ನಿಭಾಯಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಈ ಭಾಗ ಮಾಕ್ ಪಾವತಿ ಸೇವೆಯ ವಿರುದ್ಧ ಪ್ರತಿ ಬಿಂದುವಿನಲ್ಲಿ crash ಸೇರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮಧ್ಯದ ಪ್ರಕರಣದ ಎರಡು ಬಾರಿ ಶುಲ್ಕ ತೋರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, idempotency ಕೀಯಿಂದ ಸರಿಪಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಕೀ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ಸೇವೆಯನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿ ಸಮನ್ವಯಗೊಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಘಾತೀಯ backoff ವೇಳಾಪಟ್ಟಿ ಲೆಕ್ಕ ಹಾಕುತ್ತದೆ ಮತ್ತು ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಬಹುದಾದ ಮತ್ತು ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಲಾಗದ ದೋಷಗಳಿಗೆ ಮಿತಿಯುಳ್ಳ ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ಓಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ನಿಜ ಸೇವೆ ಬಳಸಿಲ್ಲ."}},{"type":"diagram","data":{"headingEn":"The Dangerous Crash Window","headingKn":"ಅಪಾಯಕಾರಿ Crash ಕಿಟಕಿ","svgCode":"<svg viewBox="0 0 300 190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="monospace" font-size="7"><rect width="300" height="190" rx="8" fill="#0f172a"/><text x="150" y="14" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">a crash between the effect and the record needs more than replay</text><rect x="10" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#022c22" stroke="#34d399"/><text x="50" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">started</text><text x="50" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">recorded</text><rect x="110" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#422006" stroke="#fbbf24"/><text x="150" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">charge</text><text x="150" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">outside effect</text><rect x="210" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#1e1b4b" stroke="#a78bfa"/><text x="250" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">crash</text><text x="250" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">before completed</text><rect x="80" y="110" width="140" height="34" rx="5" fill="#450a0a" stroke="#f87171"/><text x="150" y="125" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">key</text><text x="150" y="137" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">one charge</text><path d="M150,64 V110" stroke="#475569"/><text x="150" y="180" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">a crash between the effect and the record needs more than replay</text></svg>","captionEn":"Replay cannot know an outside effect already happened.","captionKn":"ಹೊರಗಿನ ಪರಿಣಾಮ ಈಗಾಗಲೇ ಆಗಿದೆ ಎಂದು ಮರುಪ್ರದರ್ಶನ ತಿಳಿಯಲಾರದು."}},{"type":"table","data":{"headingEn":"The crash points","headingKn":"Crash ಬಿಂದುಗಳು","headers":["Crash point","What the log says afterwards"],"rows":[["before the call","started only, nothing was charged"],["after the call, before completed","started only, but the customer was charged"],["after completed","completed, replay returns the result"],["retry policy","d0 = 2 s, dmax = 60 s, doubling"],["idempotency key","order_123_payment"]]}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Building and Testing the Ideas","textKn":"ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸಿ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"de_2.py","headingEn":"Mock payment service, the charge activity and the retry helpers","headingKn":"ಮಾಕ್ ಪಾವತಿ ಸೇವೆ, charge activity ಮತ್ತು ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ಸಹಾಯಕಗಳು","descEn":"MockPaymentService charges and remembers keys, charge_activity records started, calls the service and records completed with an optional crash, and backoff_schedule and run_with_retries model the retry policy.","descKn":"MockPaymentService ಶುಲ್ಕ ವಿಧಿಸಿ ಕೀಗಳನ್ನು ನೆನಪಿಡುತ್ತದೆ, charge_activity started ದಾಖಲಿಸಿ ಸೇವೆ ಕರೆದು ಐಚ್ಛಿಕ crash ಜೊತೆ completed ದಾಖಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು backoff_schedule ಹಾಗೂ run_with_retries ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ನೀತಿ ಮಾದರಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತವೆ.","code":"class Crash(Exception):
    pass


@dataclass
class MockPaymentService:
    use_keys: bool
    charges: list = field(default_factory=list)
    seen: dict = field(default_factory=dict)

    def charge(self, customer, amount, key=None):
        if self.use_keys and key is not None and key in self.seen:
            return self.seen[key]
        result = {"customer": customer, "amount": amount, "status": "charged", "charge_no": len(self.charges) + 1}
        self.charges.append(result)
        if self.use_keys and key is not None:
            self.seen[key] = result
        return result

    def status(self, key):
        return self.seen.get(key)


class WorkflowStore:
    """Minimal durable record: a dict of activity -> state."""

    def __init__(self):
        self.state = {}


def charge_activity(store, svc, key, crash_point=None):
    """STARTED is recorded, the service is called, then COMPLETED is recorded. crash_point picks where a crash happens."""
    s = store.state.get("charge")
    if s and s["status"] == "completed":
        return s["result"], "replayed"
    store.state["charge"] = {"status": "started"}
    if crash_point == "before_call":
        raise Crash("before call")
    result = svc.charge("customer_001", 100, key if svc.use_keys else None)
    if crash_point == "after_call":
        raise Crash("after external success, before completion record")
    store.state["charge"] = {"status": "completed", "result": result}
    return result, "executed"


def run_twice(use_keys, crash_point):
    store, svc = WorkflowStore(), MockPaymentService(use_keys)
    try:
        charge_activity(store, svc, "order_123_payment", crash_point)
    except Crash:
        pass
    charge_activity(store, svc, "order_123_payment", None)
    return len(svc.charges), store.state["charge"]["status"]


def backoff_schedule(n, d0=2.0, dmax=60.0, mult=2):
    return [min(dmax, d0 * mult ** i) for i in range(n)]


def run_with_retries(fail_times, max_attempts, error_kind="retryable"):
    attempts, delays_used = 0, []
    sched = backoff_schedule(max_attempts)
    while attempts < max_attempts:
        attempts += 1
        if attempts <= fail_times:
            if error_kind == "non_retryable":
                return {"outcome": "stopped: non-retryable error", "attempts": attempts, "waited": sum(delays_used)}
            if attempts < max_attempts:
                delays_used.append(sched[attempts - 1])
            continue
        return {"outcome": "succeeded", "attempts": attempts, "waited": sum(delays_used)}
    return {"outcome": "gave up after budget", "attempts": attempts, "waited": sum(delays_used)}"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"de_2.py","headingEn":"main(): experiments","headingKn":"main(): ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳು","descEn":"main() injects a crash at each point with and without a key, reconciles by key, prints the backoff schedule and runs bounded retries.","descKn":"main() ಕೀ ಇದ್ದು ಮತ್ತು ಇಲ್ಲದೆ ಪ್ರತಿ ಬಿಂದುವಿನಲ್ಲಿ crash ಸೇರಿಸಿ, ಕೀ ಮೂಲಕ ಸಮನ್ವಯಗೊಳಿಸಿ, backoff ವೇಳಾಪಟ್ಟಿ ಮುದ್ರಿಸಿ ಮತ್ತು ಮಿತಿಯುಳ್ಳ ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ಓಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"def main():
    section("1. Genuinely running: where the crash lands decides what happens")
    for point in (None, "before_call", "after_call"):
        n, status = run_twice(False, point)
        print(f"crash point {str(point):12} without a key: charges made {n} | final status {status}")
    print("a crash before the call and no crash both end with one charge, but a crash after the service charged and before the completion record leaves the history saying started, so the retry charges again and the customer pays twice; replay alone cannot know the first charge happened")

    section("2. Genuinely running: the same crash with an idempotency key")
    for point in (None, "before_call", "after_call"):
        n, status = run_twice(True, point)
        print(f"crash point {str(point):12} with a key:    charges made {n} | final status {status}")
    print("the service remembers the key order_123_payment and returns the first result for the repeat request, so every case ends with one charge; the guarantee comes from the service honouring the key, and this mock keeps its memory in a dict that would not survive a restart")

    section("3. Genuinely running: reconciliation instead of blind retry")
    store, svc = WorkflowStore(), MockPaymentService(True)
    try:
        charge_activity(store, svc, "order_123_payment", "after_call")
    except Crash:
        pass
    print("history says:", store.state["charge"]["status"], "| ask the service by key:", svc.status("order_123_payment"))
    found = svc.status("order_123_payment")
    if found:
        store.state["charge"] = {"status": "completed", "result": found}
    print("after reconciliation the record says:", store.state["charge"]["status"], "| charges made:", len(svc.charges))
    print("asking the service what happened to the keyed request lets the workflow record the real outcome and avoid a second request, and this only works because the lab service supports lookup by key")

    section("4. Genuinely computing: exponential backoff, d_n = min(dmax, d0 * 2^n)")
    print("delays for 8 retries with d0 = 2 s and dmax = 60 s:", backoff_schedule(8))
    print("the delay doubles from 2 seconds until it reaches the 60 second cap, so the schedule is 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 60, 60, 60; real systems add random jitter so many workers do not retry together, which this schedule leaves out")

    section("5. Genuinely running: bounded retries and error kinds")
    for fail_times, budget, kind in ((2, 5, "retryable"), (5, 3, "retryable"), (1, 5, "non_retryable")):
        print(f"fails {fail_times} time(s), budget {budget}, {kind:13} -> {run_with_retries(fail_times, budget, kind)}")
    print("a transient failure is retried until it succeeds within the budget, a step that keeps failing stops when the budget runs out instead of looping forever, and a non-retryable error such as an invalid input stops at once without waiting; the waited figure is simulated seconds and no real sleep happens")"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"
